          durable execution, identity, billing, and explainable infrastructure.
        </p>
        <div className="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
          <Link to={destination} className="button-link">
            {session.data?.authenticated ? 'Open your workspace' : 'Get started'}
          </Link>
          <a href="https://github.com/yehudacohen/applik8s" className="button-link secondary">View the source</a>
